sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Voter as Student Voter
    participant ClientA as Tab A / Client Request 1
    participant ClientB as Tab B / Client Request 2 (Concurrent)
    participant Engine as Voting Engine (PHP + MySQLi)
    participant DB as Database Transaction & Row Lock

    Note over ClientA,ClientB: Simultaneous submissions by same user for same election

    par Thread A
        ClientA->>Engine: POST /ballot (Candidate Alpha)
        Engine->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (Tx 1)
        Engine->>DB: SELECT * FROM election_participation WHERE user_id = ? FOR UPDATE
        Note over DB: Tx 1 acquires EXCLUSIVE row lock
    and Thread B
        ClientB->>Engine: POST /ballot (Candidate Beta)
        Engine->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (Tx 2)
        Engine->>DB: SELECT * FROM election_participation WHERE user_id = ? FOR UPDATE
        Note over DB: Tx 2 BLOCKS waiting for Tx 1 lock release
    end

    Note over Engine,DB: Tx 1 proceeds
    Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO election_participation (election_id, user_id, hash)
    Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO votes (election_id, candidate_id)
    Engine->>DB: COMMIT (Tx 1)
    Note over DB: Lock released. Tx 1 returns Receipt to Client A

    Note over DB: Tx 2 unblocks and reads now-committed row
    DB-->>Engine: Tx 2 detects existing participation record!
    Engine->>DB: ROLLBACK (Tx 2)
    Engine-->>ClientB: 400 Bad Request: "Ballot rejected: You have already cast your vote"
